/* ============================================================================
 * SPEAK EASILY KIDS — FIXED QUESTION SET v1.0-fix (complete: 20 topics x 12)
 * ============================================================================
 * Written in response to the review on https://articulate-english.github.io/speak-easily-kids/
 *   1. questions had no adjectives                     -> every stem is a describable anchor
 *   2. no real vocab to help students level up        -> Word Bank + Hint + Model answer per question
 *   3. follow-ups asked the same thing in different words -> Follow-Up Ladder keeps ONE answer and probes it
 *      (Probe -> Reason -> Example -> Compare -> Reflect -> Self-check)
 *
 * Embedding: paste this into lesson-data.js as window.SPEAKEASILYKIDS (free topics open,
 * the rest are delivered by the unlock service). The deck player reads: topic.slug,
 * topic.title, topic.category, topic.questions[N].q/.wordBank/.hint/.model/.ladder.
 *
 * Level: A1-A2, ages 9-12. Exam-prep framing is intended (Cambridge-style open
 * questions) with no de-branded "FCE/exam" language in the UI.
 * ========================================================================== */
